      <p class="eyebrow mb-4 mt-6">Case Study · Defence &amp; Military</p>
      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Defence Sovereign Edge Computing</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-ink/70">A national defence agency needed computing infrastructure that could operate in disconnected, denied environments — where devices may be captured and data must survive physical compromise. MEAICON delivered a sovereign edge platform with hardware-enforced security, remote zeroization, and post-quantum-ready cryptography across 120 forward-deployed nodes.</p>
